Date: Mon, 28 Mar 2022 15:45:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] [Brightoncity] Fixed [BRIG-157] [IPMI] Some sensors are shown
 in WEB but not shown in IPMI sensor list.

Related issue: [BRIG-157] [IPMI] Some sensors are shown in WEB but not shown in IPMI sensor list.

Modified file:
ServerBMC_GM/build/brightoncity/workspace/sources/entity-manager/configurations/Intel Front Panel.json

Descript:
1. Remove these sensors in WEB.
   a. Front Panel Temp

Test Step:
1. Login WEB and check this sensor if still exist in "Health->Sensors" page. It should be not exist.
